Error [E2411]: `Wrap`<Plain> can't be serialized
  --> tests/ui/serde_generic_noncodable_arg.jet:17:26
    |
 17 |     print(json.to_string(w))
    |                          ^
 Why: only types that opt in (and their fields) have a wire form; `Wrap`<Plain> does not
 Fix: add `@[Codable]` or `@[Encode]` to `Wrap`<Plain>, or remove it from the encoded value
